    <intro>&lt;div style="max-width:950px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#172033;line-height:1.6;font-size:18px;"&gt;&lt;div style="background:#17456f;color:#fff;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Notebook Evidence Submission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#eef6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-left:7px solid #2563eb;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:18px;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;What to Submit&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your completed vocabulary notes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your completed Independent Work.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#ecfdf5;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-left:7px solid #16a34a;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:18px;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;Before You Submit&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Review your work for completeness, clarity, and correct conventions before submitting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-left:7px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:18px;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;Mastery Requirement&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;A score of at least 80% is required. If you score below 80%, review your TOR’s feedback, make corrections, and resubmit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#eef6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-left:7px solid #2563eb;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:18px;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;What to Include&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the top of your work, include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Student Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Course Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit and Lesson&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;John Smith&lt;br&gt;Creative Writing – Unit 1, Lesson 4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-left:7px solid #2563eb;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:18px;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;Submission Format&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;PDF &lt;strong&gt;(preferred)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Word: DOC or DOCX&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Images: JPG, JPEG, PNG&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;If using Google Docs, download and submit your work as a PDF or Word file. &lt;strong&gt;Links are not accepted as the submission.&lt;/strong&gt; Put dictionary and research URLs within your document. Number pages and submit all pages together in order.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#f4f7fb;border:1px solid #cbd7e6;border-left:6px solid #2563eb;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:12px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧑‍🏫 TOR Help&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contact your Teacher of Record (TOR) if you need clarification, feedback, or support.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</intro>
